# NOTE: src-tauri/icons/ IS committed. build.rs embeds icon.ico, so a fresh clone
# could not `cargo build` without it. Regenerate with `npm run icons`; output is
# deterministic, so it produces no diff churn.
#
# NOTE: fixtures/ IS committed. It is a few KB of real artifacts the golden tests
# need. Secrets in it are scrubbed — see fixtures/README.md.
